  "jobTitle": "Founder & Software Developer",
  "summary": "I’m a software developer and cloud security-focused founder building GagliTech LLC, a technology company focused on secure SaaS products, AWS cloud architecture, and cybersecurity-driven software development.\nMy current flagship project is CaelaraHealth, a healthcare SaaS platform designed for functional and integrative medicine practices. The product combines secure patient/provider workflows, intake, scheduling, messaging, documentation, file handling, AI-assisted clinical drafts, and HIPAA-aware infrastructure design. The architecture is built around AWS-native services for audit logging, encryption, and infrastructure as code with CI/CD.\nMy background combines software development, cybersecurity, and cloud engineering. I hold degrees in Computer Information System Security and Software Development, and I’ve completed extensive hands-on cybersecurity training through platforms like Hack The Box Academy and TryHackMe. My work focuses on practical security: identity and access control, secure deployment pipelines, least-privilege architecture, application hardening, logging, monitoring, and building systems that are maintainable from both a developer and security perspective.\nI’m especially interested in the intersection of healthcare technology, cloud security, and AI-assisted workflows. My goal is to build software that is not only functional and scalable, but also privacy-conscious, security-first, and operationally realistic for small practices and growing businesses.\nCurrent focus areas:\n• Secure SaaS architecture\n• AWS cloud security\n• Healthcare technology\n• HIPAA-aware application design\n• Infrastructure as code\n• Secure software development\n• AI-assisted workflow automation\n• Cloud-native product development",
