    "title": "CaelaraHealth",
    "description": "CaelaraHealth is a production-deployed healthcare SaaS platform I began building in 2022 and am preparing for private beta. I designed and built the platform across the application, cloud, security, and delivery layers, with a focus on secure workflows for healthcare practices.\n\nThe platform includes provider and patient portals, conversational intake, care plans, secure messaging, scheduling, video visits, real-time captions, payments, discovery workflows, and role-based access.\n\nI architected the AWS environment using a multi-account model with separate tooling, development, staging, and production environments. Infrastructure is defined in AWS CDK and synthesized to CloudFormation, with cross-account CI/CD pipelines, automated testing and validation, production approval gates, IAM controls, secrets management, logging, monitoring, and audit-oriented controls.\n\nThe application stack includes TypeScript, Node.js, React/Next.js, PostgreSQL, REST and WebSocket APIs, automated testing, and AWS-managed services.\n\nCaelaraHealth represents several years of end-to-end product engineering, including software architecture, full-stack development, cloud infrastructure, DevSecOps, application security, production deployment, and ongoing operational design.",
