    "description": "Building GagliTech LLC, a software company focused on secure healthcare SaaS, AWS cloud security, and privacy-conscious technology solutions.\nCurrent work includes developing CaelaraHealth, a healthcare SaaS platform designed for functional and integrative medicine practices. The platform focuses on secure patient/provider workflows, practice operations, documentation support, and AI-assisted clinical draft generation with provider review.\nHighlights:\n• Building secure healthcare SaaS products with a focus on privacy, usability, and operational reliability\n• Designing AWS-hosted application environments with an emphasis on hardening, least privilege, secure configuration, and defense-in-depth\n• Creating secure deployment workflows for cloud applications, including infrastructure-as-code practices, environment separation, and controlled release processes\n• Applying cybersecurity principles to identity, access control, application security, auditability, logging, and operational monitoring\n• Supporting clinic website infrastructure, AWS hosting, domain/DNS configuration, business email setup, and ongoing technical maintenance\n• Developing software for small healthcare practices with attention to practical workflows, maintainability, and real-world security needs",
